<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan Coke strike to end by Friday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan Coke strike to end by Friday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Striking workers at two Coca-Cola Co bottling plants in Sri Lanka will end their 11-week strike under a deal with the management, a labour union leader said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We signed an agreement today with the management in the presence of the Labour Commissioner to call off the strike tomorrow and return to work on Friday,&quot; said Bala Tampoe, leader of the Ceylon Mercantile Union (CMU).</p>
</text>
